{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986680/extras/Untitled_Artwork_8-export.png?t=1743528407\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Versus Purgatory is a micro-roguelike shoot-em-up with mind-bending gameplay in which you delve into a dungeon, controlling two characters at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game takes ~2-3 hours on average to beat, with individual runs taking 10-15 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gamepad is strongly recommended!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986680/extras/gif2_large.gif?t=1743528407\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don\u2019t let the two characters fool you, this is a single-player game!</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot-em-up action! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Novel control scheme! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 unique weapons to discover! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20+ power-ups! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Millions of possible dungeons! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievements! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986680/extras/IMG_0346.PNG?t=1743528407\" />Versus Purgatory is a <i>randomly-generated action shooter roguelike</i>. Find wild and exciting new <i>weapons and power-ups</i> that change how you play. Discover secrets and fight your way to freedom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986680/extras/gif3_large.gif?t=1743528407\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986680/extras/gif4_large.gif?t=1743528407\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986680/extras/IMG_0347.PNG?t=1743528407\" />Two spirits, an angel and a devil, were sentenced to Purgatory for their deviancy. Despite their hatred for one another, they must work together to <i>shoot, blast, and zap</i> their way out of the <i>ever-changing labyrinth</i> they've been trapped in. </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Slime Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2986680/51b79947827c86d6ca5de9d602c510496e46b457.jpg"},{"name":"Spikes Savant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2986680/c4ede160ed77f216768230b74e4b07eda036096e.jpg"},{"name":"Ghoul Gladiator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2986680/38ade91e76cd6a810119bd0cda115913133a39e2.jpg"},{"name":"Dungeon Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2986680/34a6f243c26fc83b009e6e87bedc3c2a9abe9cd4.jpg"},{"name":"Big Winner!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2986680/abf66ca12f6365d0e86050be9f0320b11e318d3a.jpg"},{"name":"Speedrun!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2986680/81ec56412658df3725300e299f91af5b28a0c9ff.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2986680?t=1743528407","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2986680?t=1743528407","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986680/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743528407","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986680/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743528407","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achie